<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets one-year bond auction for Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets one-year bond auction for Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Turkish central bank said the Treasury would auction one-year bonds on Tuesday after it sold 380.1 trln lira of 287-day t-bills on February 25 and 18.6 trillion lira of inflation-indexed, two-year bonds last week.</p>
<p>The Treasury has 106.9 trillion lira of domestic debt</p>
<p>repayments due on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : March 11, 1998</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: March 11, 1997</p>
<p>Value date  : March 12, 1997</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75 GAT EKS</p>
